cff-version: 1.2.0

message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata provided below."

title: Microbiome-Master ITS: A reproducible ITS marker gene analysis pipeline
type: software
version: "1.2.0"
date-released: "2023-12-12"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AAFC-Bioinfo-AAC/microbiome-master-its.git"
license: MIT

abstract: >-
  The AAFC Bioinformatics Code Catalogue (ABCC) template repository provides a
  modular and extensible framework for developing reproducible data analysis
  pipelines within the AAFC-Bioinfo-AAC GitHub organization. It enables
  researchers and developers to quickly initialize new projects using
  parameterized, reusable components adaptable to diverse analytical workflows.

keywords:
  - reproducibility
  - microbiome
  - ITS
  - amplicon
  - bioinformatics
  - pipeline
  - Snakemake
  - AAFC

